name 'thinking-critically-about-ai-preassessment-q14_2026-pilot'

question 'Which of the following is true about how human decisions shape AI outputs?'

right 'The choices humans make about what data to collect, how to label it, and how to design AI systems all influence how the AI behaves.'
wrong 'Once an AI is created, human decisions no longer have any effect on how it behaves.'
wrong 'AI systems make completely neutral, unbiased decisions because they are machines.'
wrong 'Only the engineers who first built an AI can influence its outputs.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

